<h2>Unlock your account</h2>

<p>Hi,</p>

<p>We locked your WIT Calendar account (<strong><%= @resource.email %></strong>) after too many failed sign-in attempts.</p>

<p style="margin-top: 16px;">
  <%= link_to "Unlock my account", unlock_url(@resource, unlock_token: @token) %>
</p>

<p style="margin-top: 16px;">If you did not try to sign in, contact us at <%= mail_to Rails.application.config.x.contact_email %>.</p>
